Date: Wed, 19 Aug 2026 19:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 06/13] Add rpmalloc backend glue (--with-malloc=rpmalloc)

Shim and amalgamation TU only.  Upstream rpmalloc.c/h come from the
rpmalloc tarball unpacked into malloc/rpmalloc/ in %prep.
---
 malloc/malloc-rpmalloc-impl.c |  24 ++
 malloc/malloc-rpmalloc.c      | 496 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 520 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 malloc/malloc-rpmalloc-impl.c
 create mode 100644 malloc/malloc-rpmalloc.c

diff --git a/malloc/malloc-rpmalloc-impl.c b/malloc/malloc-rpmalloc-impl.c
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..66069f2
--- /dev/null
+++ b/malloc/malloc-rpmalloc-impl.c
@@ -0,0 +1,24 @@
